flowchart LR
  subgraph LOCAL[Operator host - application-controlled boundary]
    T[Telemetry sources\nLoki / Prometheus / probes / optional Docker]
    R[Local Markdown runbooks\nLocal ONNX embeddings + Chroma]
    P[Prompt construction\nSelect, minimise and label evidence]
    V[Structured response validation\nSeverity allowlist + schema checks]
    S[Local SQLite and audit records\nDefault application retention]
    U[Authenticated dashboard\nHuman review and approval]
    O[Optional local Ollama model\nNo cloud-model egress]
    T --> P
    R --> P
    P --> O --> V
    V --> S --> U
  end

  subgraph CLOUD[Cloud-provider boundary - provider terms apply]
    C[Configured cloud LLM\nGemini / Anthropic / OpenAI-compatible]
  end

  P -->|Selected telemetry and retrieved excerpts;\nquestion, prompt, provider/model metadata| C
  C -->|Raw model response| V

  N[Potential external exposure\nProvider processing, logs and retention depend on contract and configuration]
  C -.-> N

  L[Deployment obligations\nLawful basis, DPIA where required, processor terms, transfer safeguards, retention and access controls]
  N -.-> L

